IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `eia-core`
IMPORT `ei6-part-8-5-cessation`

-- Tests of ei6-part-8-5-cessation (Act s 153.196, src:3080-3084). Expected values are read from the text by hand.
-- "Ceases to apply on D" is read as: applies through D (fork F-ei6-7).

§ `Section 153.196 - the days`

#ASSERT `s 153.196(1) the latest day on which Part VIII.5 ceases to apply` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2021 9 25
#ASSERT `s 153.196(2) the latest day on which section 153.19 ceases to apply` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2020 10 31
#ASSERT `s 153.196(3) the day on which sections 153.1922 to 153.1924 cease to apply` EQUALS YearMonthDay 2021 12 18

§ `Section 153.196 - no repeal of Interim Order No. 8`

#ASSERT `s 153.196 the day on which the provision ceases to apply` `ei6 any other provision of Part VIII.5` NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2021 9 25
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the day on which the provision ceases to apply` `ei6 section 153.19` NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2020 10 31
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the day on which the provision ceases to apply` `ei6 sections 153.1922 to 153.1924` NOTHING EQUALS YearMonthDay 2021 12 18
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` `ei6 any other provision of Part VIII.5` (YearMonthDay 2021 9 25) NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` `ei6 any other provision of Part VIII.5` (YearMonthDay 2021 9 26) NOTHING)
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` `ei6 section 153.19` (YearMonthDay 2020 10 31) NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` `ei6 section 153.19` (YearMonthDay 2020 11 1) NOTHING)
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` `ei6 sections 153.1922 to 153.1924` (YearMonthDay 2021 12 18) NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` `ei6 sections 153.1922 to 153.1924` (YearMonthDay 2021 12 19) NOTHING)
-- the 153.1922 to 153.1924 group outlives the rest of the Part (subsection (3) is not "subject to" the Part's date).
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` `ei6 sections 153.1922 to 153.1924` (YearMonthDay 2021 10 1) NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` `ei6 any other provision of Part VIII.5` (YearMonthDay 2021 10 1) NOTHING)

§ `Section 153.196 - Interim Order No. 8 repealed`

-- repealed on January 15, 2021: the Part and section 153.19 end then; sections 153.1922 to 153.1924 do not.
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the day on which the provision ceases to apply` `ei6 any other provision of Part VIII.5` (JUST (YearMonthDay 2021 1 15)) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2021 1 15
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the day on which the provision ceases to apply` `ei6 section 153.19` (JUST (YearMonthDay 2020 9 1)) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2020 9 1
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the day on which the provision ceases to apply` `ei6 sections 153.1922 to 153.1924` (JUST (YearMonthDay 2021 1 15)) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2021 12 18
-- repealed after the fixed day: the fixed day governs.
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the day on which the provision ceases to apply` `ei6 any other provision of Part VIII.5` (JUST (YearMonthDay 2021 12 1)) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2021 9 25
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the day on which the provision ceases to apply` `ei6 section 153.19` (JUST (YearMonthDay 2020 12 1)) EQUALS YearMonthDay 2020 10 31
#ASSERT `s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` `ei6 any other provision of Part VIII.5` (YearMonthDay 2021 1 15) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2021 1 15))
#ASSERT NOT (`s 153.196 the provision applies on the day` `ei6 any other provision of Part VIII.5` (YearMonthDay 2021 1 16) (JUST (YearMonthDay 2021 1 15)))
